	ZH 1:
	'Ồ, tôi hiểu rồi!'
	\L_057f4:
	\L_057e7:
	\L_0573f:
	ZH 1:
	'W-nó là gì?'
	\L_057f4:
	\L_057e7:
	\L_056cf:
